    options: ["Gravity is a pulling force that acts between any two masses.", "The Sun's gravity pulls on the Earth and keeps it in orbit around the Sun.", "The Earth's gravity pulls on the Moon and keeps it in orbit around the Earth.", "The Moon is the Earth's natural satellite.", "The Moon travels around the Sun on its own, separately from the Earth.", "The Earth's magnetic field is the force that holds the Moon in its orbit.", "The solar wind blowing from the Sun is what pushes the Moon along in its orbit."],
